# Actual open Dolbeault resolution and unconditional punctured-product acyclicity

The actual affine Dolbeault resolution restricts exactly to any open subset
of `ℂ × ℂ`. Its actual smooth terms are genuinely acyclic, and literal global
coordinate solvability determines its genuine degree-one and degree-two
Ext groups. The constructed analytic primitives on `ℂ × ℂ*` prove every
positive cohomology group of its actual holomorphic function sheaf is zero.
